<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9882] OOME in Hadoop suite</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9882</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Hadoop suite starts failing with OOME after several commits were merged. I suspect that it may be related to &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9171&quot; title=&quot;Use lazy mode with results pre-fetch&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9171&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9171&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; merge or &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9561&quot; title=&quot;Optimize affinity initialization for started cache groups&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9561&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9561&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. See two runs:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Failure: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2063682&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_Hadoop&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2063682&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_Hadoop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
